        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 875f34c3-074c-43a1-9e39-df7ed5c0a13b).Image",
        "Description": "NEW QUEST: \r\rAttention Crawler. Haven Island has been designated as pseudo floor in the new Dungeon Cralwler Earth. \r\r5 crawlers have been flagged as still &quot;very much alive&quot; and you crawler# 47,\ryour job is to fix that. \r\rYour objective is to eliminate all 5 targets as quick as you can, do it with style, do it with all the loot you&apos;ve gathered inside the dungeon, and do it discretely. \r\rRewards: Nothing really, this is a player made contract, barely anyone plays these...do you want a cookie?",
